                "000000000004"
              ],
              "text": "Experience"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000006",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " authentic Bedouin hospitality in a charming, family-run camp surrounded by lush gardens and scenic terraces. Just a short distance from Mount Sinai, Sheikh Mousa is perfect for those planning a sunrise hike. It’s also ideal for budget-conscious travelers looking to connect deeply with local culture."
