        {
          "_key": "000000000036",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000035",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "When deciding where to stay, consider the type of experience you’re seeking, your budget, travel dates, and the amenities important to you. Whether you’re here for spiritual reflection, cultural immersion, adventurous hikes, or simply tranquility, St. Catherine has something unique to offer every traveler."
            }
          ],
